# CometGUI -- Maven command-line defaults, applied to every `mvn` invocation
# made from this repository (Maven reads .mvn/maven.config from the project
# base directory and prepends these arguments).
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the project rule is that nothing is written to the
# host's ~/.m2.  Forcing the local repository here protects *any* mvn run --
# an agent's ad-hoc `mvn test`, an IDE, CI -- not only scripts/build.sh, which
# passes an absolute -Dmaven.repo.local of its own.
#
# The path is relative and is resolved against the working directory, so run
# mvn from the repository root (scripts/build.sh always does).
-Dmaven.repo.local=_build/m2repo
